{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120805001:1":{"text":"저기, 상인 아저씨! 파이크 경이 대체 누구예요?","source_cn":"商人先生，打听一下！大家最近在谈论的荒矛老爷到底是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22272CF2E7C8D699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120805002:1":{"text":"오… 그쪽도 현상금을 노리는 사냥꾼들인가요? 모험에 필요한 망토, 갈고리, 육포 같은 것들이 필요하면 저한테 얘기하세요. 있을 건 다 있거든요! ","source_cn":"哦……你们几个也想去悬赏的热闹？要不要买些路上的防身物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1E118E59E05FFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120805003:1":{"text":"저희는 그냥 파이크 경에 대해서 알고 싶을 뿐이에요.","source_cn":"谢谢你的好意，但我们只想知道荒矛老爷的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDE0364696578CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120805004:1":{"text":"“경”이라고 불리는 분인데, 어찌 저 같은 상인이 알겠습니까.","source_cn":"老爷的事我也不知道，我只是个商人，还没有被称为“老爷”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4BAF8238C89B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120805005:1":{"text":"다만 현상금 사냥꾼들이 벌떼같이 모여드는 걸 보면, 보수가 어마어마하지 않을까 싶네요.","source_cn":"不过，那些赏金猎人们倒像是盯上了刚宰的牛肉，像苍蝇一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4240839687524E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120805006:1":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼들이 거금을 들여 장비를 사고 있으니 말이죠.","source_cn":"完成悬赏的报酬一定不菲。不然赏金猎人也不会投那么多本金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D97A7D37DBAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120805007:1":{"text":"그리고 <style=\"highlight\">“파이크 경은 얼굴을 드러내지 않는다”</style>는 소문이 있습죠. 듣기로 그의 정체를 캐내려고 하던 사람들 전부 사라졌다나 뭐라나...","source_cn":"另外，我听到一个传闻：据说，<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB0D54CAAD04A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120805008:1":{"text":"아무튼! …정보료는 동전 3개입니다~ 또 오세요!","source_cn":"——那么，作为情报费，请付铜币三枚，谢谢惠顾！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x175EAD1EDBB35BAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:行商贝尼迪":{"text":"행상 베니딕","source":"行商贝尼迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}